# Training Regimen: "At the beginning of combat on your turn, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature you control" and "Creatures you
# control with +1/+1 counters on them have trample." At the beginning of Bot1's turn 3 combat its Grizzly Bears take the counter (3/3,
# and now have trample); Bot2's Grizzly Bears can't be the target (the refusal). The counter is the whole of what gives trample: at
# the beginning of Bot1's turn 1 combat it had no creature (no target), and Bot1's second Grizzly Bears, which has no counter,
# has none; Bot2's combat (turn 2) puts nothing anywhere since it is not Bot1's turn.

